# ambient — the ambient-set file, the cross-fade, and the three set kinds.
#
# `sound/sound.txt` carries four sets. Only the three the precache list names are
# kept, so `unused` proves the precache filter. Every subwave and every gap comes
# out of Q_irand, so the draw order is part of the golden.
cvar s_khz 22
init
beginreg

# Precache the three sets cgame would ask for, then parse.
asprecache cave
asprecache vent
asprecache door
asparse
dumpsfx after-parse

# The brush-model set answers a handle per stage, and -1 outside its range.
asbmodel door 0
asbmodel door 3
asbmodel door 4
asbmodel cave 0
asbmodel missing 0

# The first general set starts a cross-fade from nothing. `realtime` is the
# scripted client clock the fade reads.
respatialize 0 0 0 0 0
asupdate cave 100 0 0 0
dumpstate after-cave1
advance 1102
update
dumpstate frame1
dumpring frame1

# Hold on the same set across the fade window, so masterVolume climbs.
asupdate cave 100 0 0 500
respatialize 0 0 0 0 0
advance 1102
update
dumpstate frame2
dumpring frame2

# Naming a different set starts the cross-fade, so both play for a while.
asupdate vent 100 0 0 1200
respatialize 0 0 0 0 0
advance 1102
update
dumpstate frame3
dumpring frame3

asupdate vent 100 0 0 2500
respatialize 0 0 0 0 0
advance 1102
update
dumpstate frame4
dumpring frame4

# A big clock jump makes the subwave gap elapse, so AS_PlayAmbientSet picks one
# through Q_irand and starts it on CHAN_AMBIENT. Dump before the paint, while
# the channel is still live.
asupdate vent 100 0 0 12000
dumpstate subwave
respatialize 0 0 0 0 0
advance 551
update
dumpstate frame5
dumpring frame5

# The local set attenuates by distance. Inside half the radius is full volume,
# past the radius is silence, and a missing set answers the realtime it was
# given. The three calls run at the same scripted clock, so only the distance
# differs.
aslocal vent 0 0 0 100 0 0 5 0 20000
dumpstate local-near
aslocal vent 0 0 0 380 0 0 5 0 20000
dumpstate local-mid
aslocal vent 0 0 0 900 0 0 5 0 20000
dumpstate local-far
aslocal missing 0 0 0 0 0 0 5 0 20000
respatialize 0 0 0 0 0
advance 1102
update
dumpstate frame6
dumpring frame6
shutdown
